screen.RAIN=Rain and Wind
screen.GROUND=Wet Ground
screen.REFLECTIONS=Puddles and Reflections
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Atmosphere and Clouds
screen.CAMERA=Camera and Lighting
profile.comment=Fast, Balanced, or Cinematic visuals. Advanced effects can be adjusted individually.
option.RAIN_DETAIL=Extra Rain Detail
option.RAIN_DETAIL.comment=Adds optional procedural rain on top of Minecraft rain. Off is most natural.
option.RAIN_DENSITY=Extra Rain Density
option.RAIN_DENSITY.comment=Controls the amount of extra rain drops.
option.RAIN_STREAK_BRIGHTNESS=Falling Rain Visibility
option.RAIN_STREAK_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Controls how noticeable falling raindrops are. Lower values are more subtle.
option.RAIN_WIND=Wind Strength
option.RAIN_WIND.comment=Slants vanilla and extra rain; also drives clouds, water and foliage during storms.
option.SILVER_RAIN=Silvery Vanilla Rain
option.SILVER_RAIN.comment=Recolors vanilla rain to a more natural silver-grey. Leaves snow alone.
option.RAIN_SPLASHES=Rain Impacts
option.RAIN_SPLASHES.comment=Tiny water impact flashes on wet, exposed surfaces.
option.WET_DARKNESS=Wet Surface Darkness
option.PUDDLE_AMOUNT=Puddle Coverage
option.PUDDLE_SIZE=Puddle Size
option.REFLECTION_QUALITY=Reflection Quality
option.REFLECTION_INTENSITY=Reflection Strength
option.RAIN_RIPPLES=Puddle Ripples
option.STORM_SKY=Storm Sky
option.STORM_CLOUDS=Moving Dark Clouds
option.STORM_CLOUD_COVER=Cloud Coverage
option.STORM_CLOUD_COVER.comment=How much of the sky fills with layered storm clouds.
option.STORM_SKY_DARKNESS=Storm Sky Darkness
option.STORM_SKY_DARKNESS.comment=How dark and heavy the storm ceiling appears.
option.STORM_CLOUD_WIND=Cloud Wind Speed
option.STORM_CLOUD_WIND.comment=Scales the shared wind speed for moving storm clouds.
option.RAIN_FOG=Rain Mist
option.FOG_AMOUNT=Mist Amount
option.RAIN_COLOR_GRADE=Cool Storm Colors
option.STORM_GLOW=Rainy-Night Light Glow
option.STORM_VIGNETTE=Subtle Storm Vignette
option.LENS_DROPLETS=Water on Camera (Optional)
option.LENS_DROPLETS.comment=Small refractive droplets around the edges of the screen. Default OFF.
value.RAIN_DETAIL.0=Off
value.RAIN_DETAIL.1=Low
value.RAIN_DETAIL.2=Balanced
value.RAIN_DETAIL.3=High
option.GRASS_PUDDLES=Grass Puddles
option.GRASS_PUDDLES.comment=Controls how much rainwater collects on exposed grass blocks.
option.RAIN_SHADER_DEBUG=Rain Render Test
option.RAIN_SHADER_DEBUG.comment=Temporary diagnostic: magenta=weather, yellow=textured, cyan=textured-lit. Turn OFF for normal rain.
value.RAIN_SHADER_DEBUG.0=Off
value.RAIN_SHADER_DEBUG.1=Test


option.WETTING_TIME=Wetness Build-up Time
option.WETTING_TIME.comment=Global wetting half-life in ticks. Higher values delay puddle formation.
option.DRYING_TIME=Drying Time
option.DRYING_TIME.comment=Global drying half-life in ticks. Wood and soil retain dampness longer than polished blocks.
option.RAIN_SHELTER=Roof Detection
option.RAIN_SHELTER.comment=Extra overhead depth pass blocks wetness under roofs within about 85 blocks. Skylight fallback beyond this range. Costs extra geometry rendering.
option.MATERIAL_ROUGHNESS=Material Reflection Softness
option.MATERIAL_ROUGHNESS.comment=Depth-aware reflection blur for rough wet stone, wood and soil. Puddles stay smoother.
option.WATER_RIPPLES=Rain on Rivers and Lakes
option.WATER_RIPPLES.comment=Rain rings, wind normals and storm sky reflections on exposed natural water.
option.WIND_GUSTS=Wind Gusts
option.WIND_GUSTS.comment=Shared smooth gusts for rain, clouds, water and foliage.
option.FOLIAGE_WIND=Storm Foliage Movement
option.FOLIAGE_WIND.comment=Subtle movement of leaves, grass and ferns during rain. Clear weather remains still.
option.SKY_QUALITY=Storm Sky Detail
option.SKY_QUALITY.comment=Fast uses fewer noise layers; High adds detailed horizon cloud banks. Also affects reflected clouds.
value.SKY_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.SKY_QUALITY.1=Balanced
value.SKY_QUALITY.2=High
option.THUNDER_ATMOSPHERE=Heavier Thunderstorms
option.THUNDER_ATMOSPHERE.comment=Thunderstorms get darker cloud ceilings and denser mist than ordinary showers.
option.MIST_HEIGHT=Mist Height
option.MIST_HEIGHT.comment=World height of the low mist layer. Raising the camera does not raise the layer.
option.STORM_CLOUDS.comment=Moving cloud shapes in the procedural storm sky and its reflections. Requires Storm Sky.
option.PUDDLE_SIZE.comment=Changes the world-space size of puddle patches independently of coverage.

option.MATERIAL_WET_PATTERNS=Material Wet Patterns
option.MATERIAL_WET_PATTERNS.comment=Water favours plank seams and block joints. Wood gets a damp sheen rather than broad mirror patches.
option.WALL_RUNOFF=Wall Runoff
option.WALL_RUNOFF.comment=Fine animated water trails on exposed stone and clear glass during rain.
option.ROOF_DRIPS=Roof-edge Drips
option.ROOF_DRIPS.comment=Nearby visual drips and tiny landing rings inferred from captured roof and ledge edges. Requires Roof Detection; Extended costs more.
value.ROOF_DRIPS.0=Off
value.ROOF_DRIPS.1=Nearby
value.ROOF_DRIPS.2=Extended
option.LIGHTNING_RESPONSE=Lightning Flash Strength
option.LIGHTNING_RESPONSE.comment=Extra coordinated response in clouds, puddles, wet terrain, water and mist. Zero disables the extra response.
option.CLEARING_SKY=Clearing Weather
option.CLEARING_SKY.comment=Cloud breaks and subtly warmer outdoor colours while the world dries after rain.
option.AFTER_RAIN_RAINBOW=After-rain Rainbow
option.AFTER_RAIN_RAINBOW.comment=Faint rainbow opposite a low daytime sun during clearing weather. Off by default; enabled in Cinematic.
